pbsamoa bai-build creates an index file:

  $ cp "${TESTDIR}"/../data/diverse.bam test.bam
  $ "${PBSAMOA}" bai-build test.bam 2>/dev/null
  $ test -f test.bam.bai

Query with pbsamoa-built index, pbsamoa matches samtools:

  $ cp "${TESTDIR}"/../data/diverse.bam query.bam
  $ "${PBSAMOA}" bai-build query.bam 2>/dev/null
  $ "${PBSAMOA}" bai-query query.bam chr1:1-1000 | grep -v "^@" | sort > pbsamoa_query.txt
  $ samtools view query.bam chr1:1-1000 | sort > samtools_query.txt
  /usr/bin/sh: 14: samtools: not found
  $ diff pbsamoa_query.txt samtools_query.txt
  1,10d0
  < array_tag\t0\tchr1\t600\t30\t5M\t*\t0\t0\tACGTA\tIIIII\tXA:B:i,1,2,3,4,5 (esc)
  < deletion\t0\tchr1\t20\t30\t5M3D5M\t*\t0\t0\tACGTAACGTA\tIIIIIIIIII\tNM:i:3 (esc)
  < hard_clip\t0\tchr1\t100\t30\t3H7M\t*\t0\t0\tACGTACG\tIIIIIII\tNM:i:0 (esc)
  < insertion\t0\tchr1\t10\t30\t5M2I3M\t*\t0\t0\tACGTANNCGT\tIIIIIIIIII\tNM:i:2 (esc)
  < no_qual\t0\tchr1\t500\t30\t5M\t*\t0\t0\tACGTA\t* (esc)
  < paired_r1\t99\tchr1\t200\t30\t10M\t=\t300\t110\tACGTACGTAC\tIIIIIIIIII\tNM:i:0\tRG:Z:rg1 (esc)
  < paired_r2\t147\tchr1\t300\t30\t10M\t=\t200\t-110\tACGTACGTAC\tIIIIIIIIII\tNM:i:1 (esc)
  < secondary\t256\tchr1\t400\t0\t5M\t*\t0\t0\tACGTA\tIIIII\tNM:i:0 (esc)
  < skip\t0\tchr1\t50\t30\t3M100N3M\t*\t0\t0\tACGACG\tIIIIII\tNM:i:0\tXS:A:+ (esc)
  < soft_clip\t0\tchr1\t1\t30\t2S8M\t*\t0\t0\tNNACGTACGT\tIIIIIIIIII\tNM:i:0\tRG:Z:rg1 (esc)
  [1]

Query specific region returns subset:

  $ "${PBSAMOA}" bai-query query.bam chr1:200-310 | grep -v "^@" | wc -l | sed 's/ //g'
  2

Query chr2 returns chr2 records:

  $ "${PBSAMOA}" bai-query query.bam chr2:1-500 | grep -v "^@" | wc -l | sed 's/ //g'
  2

Empty region returns no records:

  $ "${PBSAMOA}" bai-query query.bam chr1:999-1000 | grep -v "^@" | wc -l | sed 's/ //g'
  0
